## Interface: 16001
## Title: Obvi Guide: Zygor
## Notes: Hands the guides of your own installed Zygor addon to Obvi Guide in game (nothing is copied), then stops Zygor; Options > AddOns > Obvi Guide: Zygor picks which of its features keep running. Not published: friends may use it, but it isn't promoted.
## Dependencies: ObviGuide
## SavedVariables: ObviGuideZygorDB
## OptionalDeps: ZygorGuidesViewerForever

ZygorParser.lua
ZygorBridge.lua
Options.lua
